[/dim]prompts/202608/gate_input_panel.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-q3[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-q3/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Vim editing for every typed freeform field[/bold #D7AFFF]                    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]editors[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]editors: give the shared TypedInputForm a masked single-line vim editor [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]for secret fields and a multi-line vim editor for text-typed and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]repeatable fields, and route each editor's vim mode display to a host [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]screen hook.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]The GateInputPanel modal and its pure request model[/bold #D7AFFF]           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]panel[dim] · [dim][/dim]after editors[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]panel: add the pure per-option input request/collection model and the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]GateInputPanel modal screen that renders it, with a tab/shift+tab focus [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]ring, live validity, drafts, and a submit that returns per-option [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]values.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Route every gate submission through the panel[/bold #D7AFFF]                 [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]wire[dim] · [dim][/dim]after panel[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]wire: make GateBranchControls open the panel when a selection needs [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]typed input, delete the inline Inputs section and the inline feedback [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]box, and simplify the focus ring and submit-state bookkeeping in both [/#D7D7AF]\n   